236
00:11:42,495 --> 00:11:43,201
[Ghost Kurtis] Not content.

237
00:11:43,201 --> 00:11:45,963
[Ghost Kurtis] Productive compute for collaboration on demand.

238
00:11:45,963 --> 00:11:48,020
[Ghost Kurtis] Every time it runs, it gets better.

239
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:51,664
[Ghost Kurtis] Every time it runs, it reviews itself and refines the process.

240
00:11:51,664 --> 00:11:52,840
[Ghost Kurtis] The skill compounds.

241
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,839
[Ghost Kurtis] That's the asset.

