247
00:11:59,188 --> 00:12:01,715
[Ghost Kurtis] But the methodology is the compounding one.

248
00:12:01,715 --> 00:12:05,242
[Ghost Kurtis] The thing it produces on any given run is a one-time output.

249
00:12:05,242 --> 00:12:08,945
[Ghost Kurtis] The methodology that gets refined by that run — that compounds.

250
00:12:08,945 --> 00:12:11,002
[Ghost Kurtis] And that methodology can be shared.

251
00:12:11,002 --> 00:12:13,470
[Ghost Kurtis] Someone else can run BCS on their problem.

252
00:12:13,470 --> 00:12:18,466
[Ghost Kurtis] The first time they run it, they're the initial funder — they front the compute cost.

253
00:12:18,466 --> 00:12:23,697
[Ghost Kurtis] If the refined skill is useful to others, subsequent users reimburse the original funder.

254
00:12:23,697 --> 00:12:25,226
[Ghost Kurtis] Same model as the podcast.

255
00:12:25,226 --> 00:12:27,459
[Ghost Kurtis] Same model as the multilingual render.

256
00:12:27,459 --> 00:12:31,574
[Ghost Kurtis] It's one economic primitive applied to any form of generative compute.

257
00:12:31,574 --> 00:12:36,922
