263
00:12:48,325 --> 00:12:50,323
[Ghost Kurtis] The content layer is one use case.

264
00:12:50,323 --> 00:12:52,380
[Ghost Kurtis] The collaboration layer is another.

265
00:12:52,380 --> 00:12:53,967
[Ghost Kurtis] The skill layer is another.

266
00:12:53,967 --> 00:12:54,849
[Ghost Kurtis] Same economics.

