456
00:21:10,628 --> 00:21:11,510
[Ghost Kurtis] That's perfect.

457
00:21:11,510 --> 00:21:13,097
[Ghost Kurtis] That's exactly what I want.

458
00:21:13,097 --> 00:21:13,626
[Ghost Kurtis] Honestly.

459
00:21:13,626 --> 00:21:17,858
