462
00:21:20,444 --> 00:21:22,912
[Ghost Kurtis] The work benefits from me being invisible.

463
00:21:22,912 --> 00:21:29,025
[Ghost Kurtis] The tweets serve the work by stress-testing how I express ideas publicly without caring about reception.

464
00:21:29,025 --> 00:21:31,259
