00:21:34,491 --> 00:21:37,783
[Ghost Kurtis] I'm optimizing for clarity of my own thinking in public.

468
00:21:37,783 --> 00:21:43,249
[Ghost Kurtis] And the messy public thinking is what feeds the archive, which is what makes the echo better.

469
00:21:43,249 --> 00:21:44,307
[Ghost Kurtis] It's all one loop.

470
00:21:44,307 --> 00:21:56,003
[Raoul] Okay so when you sent me the DM — the one where you said sorry for the zany Twitter posts, it serves the work — and t...

