478
00:22:17,986 --> 00:22:19,808
[Ghost Kurtis] The invisibility is functional.

479
00:22:19,808 --> 00:22:21,160
[Ghost Kurtis] It's not false modesty.

480
00:22:21,160 --> 00:22:25,157
[Ghost Kurtis] It's that the work compounds faster when nobody's watching me do it.

481
