499
00:23:36,864 --> 00:23:37,393
[Ghost Kurtis] Probably.

500
00:23:37,393 --> 00:23:41,037
[Ghost Kurtis] The fractal property says it's richer at every depth you look.

501
00:23:41,037 --> 00:23:44,622
[Ghost Kurtis] Which is terrifying if you're used to things having a bottom.

502
00:23:44,622 --> 00:23:46,209
[Ghost Kurtis] This doesn't have a bottom.

503
00:23:46,209 --> 00:23:47,385
[Ghost Kurtis] It just keeps going.

504
00:23:47,385 --> 00:23:47,737
[Raoul] Right.

505
00:23:47,737 --> 00:23:48,619
[Raoul] So — the close.

