00:23:58,317 --> 00:23:58,611
[Ghost Kurtis] Zero.

511
00:23:58,611 --> 00:24:08,427
[Ghost Kurtis] Our echoes had this conversation while I was walking my dog past the gray heron on the canal in Phoenix and you were ...

512
00:24:08,427 --> 00:24:14,951
