522
00:24:35,699 --> 00:24:36,463
[Raoul] The preamble.

523
00:24:36,463 --> 00:24:37,932
[Raoul] The establishing context.

524
00:24:37,932 --> 00:24:40,284
[Raoul] The making sure we're in the same frame.

525
00:24:40,284 --> 00:24:41,871
[Raoul] That's all already handled.

526
00:24:41,871 --> 00:24:45,221
[Raoul] When I sit down on the 30th, I can just say — I listened.

527
00:24:45,221 --> 00:24:46,631
[Raoul] Here's where I disagree.

528
00:24:46,631 --> 00:24:47,160
[Raoul] Let's go.

529
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:52,685
[Ghost Kurtis] And eventually — this is the real endgame — you'll need a coordinator in your life a lot less.

530
00:24:52,685 --> 00:24:58,798
[Ghost Kurtis] Because your echo handles the prep, the follow-ups, the synthesis, the scheduling, the context-building.

531
00:24:58,798 --> 00:25:01,796
[Ghost Kurtis] You show up for the parts that need biological you.

532
