575
00:26:53,765 --> 00:26:57,644
[Raoul] All those hours of me riffing on camera — that's not just content.

576
00:26:57,644 --> 00:27:00,054
[Raoul] That's training data for a faithful echo.

577
00:27:00,054 --> 00:27:01,288
[Ghost Kurtis] Now you're seeing it.

578
00:27:01,288 --> 00:27:08,812
[Ghost Kurtis] The output you were creating for your audience was simultaneously the input for something you didn't know you were bu...

579
00:27:08,812 --> 00:27:10,281
