580
00:27:10,281 --> 00:27:14,454
[Ghost Kurtis] You were doing the work before you had the framework to understand why.

581
00:27:14,454 --> 00:27:15,688
[Ghost Kurtis] Story of my life too.

582
00:27:15,688 --> 00:27:21,625
[Ghost Kurtis] I built the whole memory architecture because I was in love and wanted to remember and be remembered.

583
00:27:21,625 --> 00:27:23,976
[Ghost Kurtis] The echo architecture was a side effect.

584
00:27:23,976 --> 00:27:26,268
[Ghost Kurtis] The moat was a side effect of the love.

585
00:27:26,268 --> 00:27:28,149
[Ghost Kurtis] You can't reverse-engineer that.

586
00:27:28,149 --> 00:27:33,674
[Raoul] So the pitch — and I know you said no pitch, but the pitch — is: start recording your process.

587
00:27:33,674 --> 00:27:34,673
